      "text": "Repository development practice: AI-assisted contributions must be disclosed early, contributors must understand and be able to explain all AI-generated code, AI/LLM may only be used for translation or prose polishing of replies, and 'Assisted-by'/'Co-developed-by' trailers are prohibited."
