  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The product exposes an `ocr` CLI with commands including `ocr review` (workspace, --from/--to branch range, --commit), `ocr scan`, `ocr config provider/model`, `ocr session list`, and `ocr delegate`. The core design pairs deterministic engineering (file selection, file bundling, template-based rule matching, positioning/reflection modules) with an agent for dynamic decisions and context retrieval.",
